<p id="mwNQ">gives an example of a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quintic_threefold" title="Quintic threefold" id="mwNg">quintic threefold</a>. It can be difficult to find explicit examples of complete intersections of higher dimensional varieties using two or more explicit examples (bestiary), but, there is an explicit example of a 3-fold of type <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt12" id="mwNw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"(2,4)"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle (2,4)}">
