    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle \mathbb {P} ^{1}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/5e38808c13ecc929e128079b70c1642554e2a4b3" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:2.475ex; height:2.676ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \mathbb {P} ^{1}}"/></span> giving the embedding (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Veronese_map" title="Veronese map" id="mwQw">Veronese map</a>)</p>
<dl id="mwRA"><dd id="mwRQ"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt17" id="mwRg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\mathbb{P}_R^1 \\to \\mathbb{P}_R^3"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \mathbb {P} _{R}^{1}\to \mathbb {P} _{R}^{3}}">
  <semantics>
