  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/6a62a486fc9058d0f11e268f8eefbd2978342fb4" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:9.414ex; height:3.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \mathbb {P} _{R}^{1}\to \mathbb {P} _{R}^{3}}"/></span> by <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt18" id="mwRw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"[s:t] \\mapsto [s^3:s^2t:st^2:t^3]."}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle [s:t]\mapsto [s^{3}:s^{2}t:st^{2}:t^{3}].}">
