  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/0d69f51ba2ae0cfe217c7d2f745f1d97684f9ad2" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -3.005ex; width:55.821ex; height:6.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \sum _{n=0}^{\infty }\chi (X_{n}(a_{1},\ldots ,a_{r}))z^{n}={\frac {a_{1}\cdots a_{r}}{(1-z)^{2}}}\prod _{i=1}^{r}{\frac {1}{(1+(a_{i}-1)z)}}.}"/></span></dd></dl>

